# sourceIdentifier is an account number unless sourceIdentifierType says CLABE or CARD; either way it
# returns the account's transactions, whether they were created with the number, the CLABE or the card.
# A customer only sees their own; an ADMIN sees anyone's.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transaction/query
@customerToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@adminToken = PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_auth.http
@accountNumber = ACC-1774713408076
@clabe = 002010113717262634
@cardNumber = 4123450000000001
@transactionCode = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### History by account number (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### History by CLABE (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?sourceIdentifier={{clabe}}&sourceIdentifierType=CLABE&status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### History by card (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?sourceIdentifier={{cardNumber}}&sourceIdentifierType=CARD&status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Paginated: page from 0, size 1-100 (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/all?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### By year (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/status-year?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### COMPLETED transactions of several accounts (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/by-accounts?accountNumbers={{accountNumber}},ACC-1847392018473
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Highest amount (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/max?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Date range (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/date-range?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED&startDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00&endDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Amount range (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/amount-range?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED&minAmount=500.00&maxAmount=2000.00
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### By transaction code; another customer's is 404 (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{transactionCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Those created with an identifier type: ACCOUNT, CLABE or CARD (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/identifier-type?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED&identifierType=CLABE
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### By keyword in the description or reason (ADMIN, CUSTOMER_BASIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/keyword?sourceIdentifier={{accountNumber}}&status=COMPLETED&keyword=rent
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
